  <description lang="en-GB" default="true">A sword by an unknown swordsmith. It cuts reasonably well. (Drawn)\nAttacking Strength:★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ja-JP" default="false">誰が鍛えたのか不明の刀。切れ味はそれなりのようだ。（抜刀状態）\n攻撃力 ：★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-US" default="false">A sword by an unknown swordsmith. It cuts reasonably well. (Drawn)\nAttacking Strength:★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-SG" default="false">A sword by an unknown swordsmith. It cuts reasonably well. (Drawn)\nAttacking Strength:★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="fr-FR" default="false">Une épée forgée par un forgeron inconnu. Elle coupe plutôt bien. (Dégainée)\nPuissance d’attaque : ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="es-ES" default="false">Una espada de un herrero desconocido. Corta razonablemente bien. (Desenvainada)\nFuerza de ataque: ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="it-IT" default="false">Una spada di un fabbro sconosciuto. Taglia abbastanza bene. (Sguainata)\nPotenza d'attacco: ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="de-DE" default="false">Ein Schwert eines unbekannten Schmieds. Es schneidet recht gut. (Gezogen)\nAngriffsstärke: ★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-HK" default="false">由無名劍匠打造的劍，斬切力尚可。（拔刀）\n攻擊力：★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-TW" default="false">由無名劍匠打造的劍，斬切力尚可。（拔刀）\n攻擊力：★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ko-KR" default="false">이름 없는 검으로, 무명의 대장장이가 만든 것이다. 제법 잘 베인다. (발도)\n공격력: ★+[#Legal]</description>
